      "text": "Only if you have domain expertise, true for any work you do with ai. (excluding fable 5 and mythos)\n\nFor me unreal 5+ blender + gpt is best combo.\n\nI am more interested in world generation, rather than game, \n\nthough I like to play my own made ones (coding games for fun at new good model launches become hobby now).",
